{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"unnamedTransformableArchiving","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UnnamedTransformableArchiving","identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/UnnamedTransformableArchiving","preciseIdentifier":"s:9Ensembles29UnnamedTransformableArchivingO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"set","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/MigratingFromEnsembles2"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Core Data itself saves such an attribute with a keyed archive WITHOUT secure coding,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as did Ensembles 2. With the default, only Foundation property-list values and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attribute’s declared value class sync; any other value (a class that adopts only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSCoding"},{"type":"text","text":", or an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPredicate"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"NSAttributedString","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or colour on an attribute with no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"declared class) is logged and not synced. If your attributes hold such values, or the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"cloud holds Ensembles 2 data for them, set this to"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/UnnamedTransformableArchiving\/keyedArchiver"},{"text":". Attributes that name a transformer are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not affected. Set it before the first attach, and the same on every device. A value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refused before the change syncs only when the attribute next changes, or when the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store is detached and attached again.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CoreDataEnsemble\/unnamedTransformableArchiving","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles","doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CoreDataEnsemble"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"unnamedTransformableArchiving","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UnnamedTransformableArchiving","preciseIdentifier":"s:9Ensembles29UnnamedTransformableArchivingO","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:9Ensembles16CoreDataEnsembleC29unnamedTransformableArchivingAA07UnnamedfG0Ovp","title":"unnamedTransformableArchiving","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"Ensembles"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How transformable attributes that name no value transformer in the model are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"archived into events and unarchived when merging. Defaults to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/UnnamedTransformableArchiving\/secureCoding"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ensembles\/coredataensemble\/unnamedtransformablearchiving"]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Ensembles/documentation/Ensembles":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sync Core Data and SwiftData stores across devices using event sourcing."}],"type":"topic","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ensembles","identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles","kind":"symbol","title":"Ensembles"},"doc://Ensembles/documentation/Ensembles/MigratingFromEnsembles2":{"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/MigratingFromEnsembles2","title":"Migrating from Ensembles 2","abstract":[{"text":"Transition an existing Ensembles 2 (Objective-C) app to Ensembles 3.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ensembles\/migratingfromensembles2","type":"topic","role":"article"},"doc://Ensembles/documentation/Ensembles/UnnamedTransformableArchiving/secureCoding":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Secure coding ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSSecureUnarchiveFromDataTransformer"},{"type":"text","text":" behaviour). Values are decoded"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"against the Foundation plist classes plus the attribute’s declared value class (its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom Class in the model). Any other value, such as a class that adopts only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSCoding"},{"type":"text","text":", or an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPredicate"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSAttributedString"},{"type":"text","text":" on an attribute that declares"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no class, is not synced: its change is logged as an error and left out of the event,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so other devices keep their own value. Default."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/UnnamedTransformableArchiving\/secureCoding","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"secureCoding","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ensembles\/unnamedtransformablearchiving\/securecoding","title":"UnnamedTransformableArchiving.secureCoding","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://Ensembles/documentation/Ensembles/UnnamedTransformableArchiving/keyedArchiver":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/UnnamedTransformableArchiving\/keyedArchiver","title":"UnnamedTransformableArchiving.keyedArchiver","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core Data’s own behaviour for a transformable attribute with no transformer name, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that of Ensembles 2: a keyed archive without secure coding. Use it when such an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attribute holds classes that adopt only "},{"code":"NSCoding","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or when the cloud holds data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"written by Ensembles 2 for such an attribute. Unarchiving instantiates whatever"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"classes the archive names, so use it only for data your own app writes. Give such"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"classes a value-based "},{"code":"isEqual(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so that re-applying an unchanged value during a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"merge is recognised as no change (Core Data relies on the same)."}],"fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"keyedArchiver","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ensembles\/unnamedtransformablearchiving\/keyedarchiver","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://Ensembles/documentation/Ensembles/CoreDataEnsemble/unnamedTransformableArchiving":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"unnamedTransformableArchiving","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:9Ensembles29UnnamedTransformableArchivingO","text":"UnnamedTransformableArchiving","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"How transformable attributes that name 